      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想牠會不會是在找\n那條圍巾的主人。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3726067034E0D6703662F5728627E000A90A3689D570D5DFE76844E3B4EBA300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，線索只有那條圍巾\n和上頭刺繡的名字<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>斐托<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C7DDA7D2253EA670990A3689D570D5DFE000A548C4E0A982D523A7E617684540D5B5700100002FF0000066590625800100002FF000000300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊嘎！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A560EFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看！牠剛才對\n斐托這個名字有反應了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3770BFF017260525B624D5C0D000A659062589019500B540D5B57670953CD61C94E86300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有沒有認識對圍巾之類\n比較熟悉的人啊？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B367096C9267098A8D8B585C0D570D5DFE4E4B985E000A6BD48F03719F608976844EBA554AFF1F00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "去問琵魯",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53BB554F74359B6F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "去問玳蘿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53BB554F73B3863F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "圍巾？\n不是琵魯比較清楚嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n抱歉我幫不上忙呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "570D5DFEFF1F000A4E0D662F74359B6F6BD48F036E05695A55CEFF1F00100001BE00000A62B16B4962115E6B4E0D4E0A5FD954623002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "圍巾是嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "570D5DFE662F55CEFF1F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我對布料和質地還算了解，\n但再怎麼說光憑一條圍巾，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我不會知道主人是誰的喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713662115C0D5E036599548C8CEA573090847B974E8689E3FF0C000A4F46518D600E9EBC8AAA514961914E00689D570D5DFEFF0C00100001BE00000A62114E0D670377E590534E3B4EBA662F8AB0768455943002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了，\n去問問亞莎美小姐如何？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF0C000A53BB554F554F4E9E838E7F8E5C0F59D059824F55FF1F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "時尚服飾館的亞莎美小姐雖然不好應付，\n但她是個專業的設計師，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而且對各種布料都很熟悉呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66425C1A670D98FE992876844E9E838E7F8E5C0F59D096D671364E0D597D61C94ED8FF0C000A4F465979662F500B5C08696D76848A2D8A085E2BFF0C00100001BE00000A800C4E145C0D54047A2E5E03659990FD5F88719F608954623002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的話，\n一定能找到圍巾的主人的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B376848A71FF0C000A4E005B9A80FD627E5230570D5DFE76844E3B4EBA76843002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳找到方向了呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n為了藍鴉也好，\n請找出圍巾的主人吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B3627E523065B954114E865462300200100001BE01000A70BA4E8685CD9D094E5F597DFF0C000A8ACB627E51FA570D5DFE76844E3B4EBA5427300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了藍鴉也好，\n請找出圍巾的主人吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
