      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "儘管相當地髒，\n但從設計和使用的布料來看，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n這是伽勒爾地區宮門市的\n某間學校發放給新生的圍巾。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而且是3年前的東西了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51187BA176F8757657309AD2FF0C000A4F465F9E8A2D8A08548C4F7F752876845E0365994F86770BFF0C00100001BE01000A9019662F4F3D52D2723E573053405BAE95805E027684000A67D095935B786821767C653E7D6665B0751F7684570D5DFE300200100001BE00000A800C4E14662F00335E74524D76846771897F4E863002001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說，這條圍巾在哪裡拿到的？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
