      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A560EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真的假的！？\n我們可是在伽勒爾地區相遇的耶。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你竟然飛越海洋過來？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
