      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A560EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "訓練家<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ哥哥姐姐！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是為了藍鴉來找我的對吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
